# Example extra static site. Copy to the server's sites folder (see DEPLOY.md
# "Extra static sites") as <name>.caddy, next to a <name>/ folder holding the
# site's files, and replace example.com with the site's real hostname.
example.com {
	import static_site example
	# Search engines are told not to index by default. To allow indexing,
	# override it after the import:
	# header X-Robots-Tag "all"
	#
	# HSTS includes subdomains by default. On a client's own apex domain that
	# would force HTTPS on all of their subdomains, so drop it there:
	# header Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
	#
	# The default CSP blocks inline <script>, <style> and style="" attributes.
	# A header set after the import replaces the snippet's whole policy, so an
	# override must restate all of it. This is the default plus 'unsafe-inline'
	# for scripts and styles, for a single-file page:
	# header Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'"
}
